// Uppercase root file, inner-same-name-boc sub-case (YZC-0093): wrapping a
// bare list of variant constructors directly (no plain fields, no inner
// same-name boc) is NOT recognized — `Approved(book Book)` parses as a call
// to an undefined function `Approved`, not a constructor decl. Filed as a
// gap; routing around it with the documented inner-boc sub-case instead.
BorrowResult: {
    Approved(book Book)
    Denied(reason String)
}
